WEBVTT

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:03.801
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:04.881 --> 00:00:06.127
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> I’m a journalist.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.656
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Really? How interesting!

00:00:10.606 --> 00:00:11.257
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:12.305 --> 00:00:14.198
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Do you work for a newspaper?

00:00:14.443 --> 00:00:17.213
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> No, for TV. What about you?

00:00:18.966 --> 00:00:19.593
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:20.673 --> 00:00:22.231
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> I’m on vacation now.

00:00:22.421 --> 00:00:23.270
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Me too.